{
	"Name": "Search - Okta - System - Location - Sign-In City [chart]",
	"Description": "Counts Okta sign-in activity by the city of the source address.\n\nGeography and network ownership come from Okta's own client.geographicalContext and securityContext, which Okta resolves at the edge at request time. The maxmind and asn_db resources from the Gravwell Network Enrichment kit are used only as a fallback, for the small number of events that arrive without Okta's enrichment.\n\nRenders as a chart.",
